| `scripts/jobs/conflict_guard.py` | Finds the conflict hunks copier's inline update leaves, and is the guard every copier job runs before it imports anything from the project: a conflicted module or data file the job reads is refused, naming the file, the line and the command that finishes the update. | runs under `copier update`, before each job | [`import_layers.may_end_the_process.<name>`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Finds hunks; it resolves none: `scripts/jobs/resolve_stamp_conflicts.py` resolves a stamp hunk. It is the one shared module that may end the process, for the reason config states. | [generate-and-upgrade.md](../guides/generate-and-upgrade.md) | always |
